    "body": "## Motivation\n\nOut-of-tree platforms may need platform-specific Mamba state storage operations. Overriding the public lifecycle methods duplicates SGLang's ReplaySSM and sibling-state handling and makes those implementations drift as the lifecycle evolves.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Split the state writes in clear, copy, and CPU restore into protected methods while retaining lifecycle coordination in `MambaPool`.\n- Let an out-of-tree platform provide a `MambaPool` subclass, with the built-in pool as the default.\n- Document the extension point and cover its conservative default.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nThe default implementation contains the same state writes in the same lifecycle order. The staged integration passed the focused Mamba state, GDN, and KDA tests.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nThis changes request-state lifecycle dispatch only and does not add work to the per-token path. Existing platforms keep the built-in implementation.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [x] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #35493048158](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35493048158)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #35493047925](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35493047925)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #35493048070](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35493048070)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
